<p>Your voice itself is not putting on a good performance. Your tone is not serious, and your reading style is, um, unprofessional. Write your shit down, and read it back. The police are, for the most part, bumbling idiots (no offense). The police also do not face mass casualties and end-of-the-world scenarios if they fuck up or someone misunderstands them.</p>
<p>Also, the dry dial tone expungement during the interview scared the shit out of me. Fix that to something else or at least keep it from jumping the fuck out of everything else.</p>

